               PERFORM VALIDATE-NCD-YEARS-0002.
               PERFORM FILE-ACCESS-0003.
               PERFORM AUDIT-TAX-BAND-0004.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-MODEL-0005.
               PERFORM FILE-ACCESS-0006.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-TERM-0007.
               PERFORM AUDIT-AGENT-CODE-0008.
